{"spec": "v1", "title": "板块示例：木板放在粗糙地面上，滑块滑上木板", "constants": {"g": 10}, "params": {"M": [2, "kg", "木板 M = 2 kg"], "m": [1, "kg", "滑块 m = 1 kg"], "v0": [6, "m/s", "以 v₀ = 6 m/s 滑上木板左端"], "mu1": [0.4, "", "滑块与木板间 μ₁ = 0.4"], "mu2": [0.1, "", "木板与地面间 μ₂ = 0.1"]}, "scene": {"surfaces": [{"id": "地面", "kind": "ground", "y": 0, "mu": "mu2"}], "bodies": [{"id": "B", "kind": "board", "m": "M", "length": 100, "on": "地面", "x": 0}, {"id": "A", "kind": "block", "m": "m", "on": "B", "at": 0, "v": "v0"}], "friction": [{"between": ["A", "B"], "mu": "mu1"}]}, "asks": [{"id": "1", "text": "共速所用时间", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "expr": "t", "answer": "4/3", "predict": {"q": "滑块滑上木板后，木板会不会动？", "options": ["不动，地面摩擦把它拦住了", "向右加速"], "answer": 2}}, {"id": "2", "text": "共速时速度", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "expr": "v(A)", "answer": "2/3"}, {"id": "3", "text": "滑块相对木板滑动距离", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "expr": "rel(A)", "answer": 4}, {"id": "4", "text": "全过程摩擦生热", "expr": "Q()", "answer": 18, "predict": {"q": "共速之后，两者会怎样运动？", "options": ["一起减速到停下", "又相对滑动，滑块比木板减速快", "又相对滑动，木板比滑块减速快"], "answer": 1}}], "solution": {"1": [{"say": "滑块比木板快，受到向左的滑动摩擦力，减速。", "tex": "a_A=\\mu_1 g=4\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}", "at": {"event": "time", "t": 0.35}, "show": {"forces": ["A"]}, "check": {"at": {"event": "time", "t": 0.35}, "expr": "abs(a(A))", "value": 4}}, {"say": "木板受滑块向右的摩擦力和地面向左的摩擦力，合力向右，加速。", "tex": "a_B=\\dfrac{\\mu_1 mg-\\mu_2(M+m)g}{M}=0.5\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}", "at": {"event": "time", "t": 0.7}, "show": {"forces": ["B"]}, "check": {"at": {"event": "time", "t": 0.7}, "expr": "a(B)", "value": 0.5}}, {"say": "两者速度相等时，相对滑动结束。这就是所求的时刻。", "tex": "v_0-a_At=a_Bt\\ \\Rightarrow\\ t=\\dfrac{v_0}{a_A+a_B}=\\dfrac{4}{3}\\ \\mathrm{s}", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "check": {"at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "expr": "t", "value": "4/3"}}], "2": [{"say": "把共速时间代回木板的运动。", "tex": "v=a_Bt=0.5\\times\\dfrac43=\\dfrac23\\ \\mathrm{m/s}", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}}], "3": [{"say": "这段时间滑块对地的位移。", "tex": "x_A=\\dfrac{v_0+v}{2}t=\\dfrac{40}{9}\\ \\mathrm{m}", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "show": {"span": ["A"]}, "check": {"at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "expr": "dx(A)", "value": "40/9"}}, {"say": "同一段时间木板对地的位移。", "tex": "x_B=\\dfrac{v}{2}t=\\dfrac49\\ \\mathrm{m}", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "show": {"span": ["B"]}, "check": {"at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "expr": "dx(B)", "value": "4/9"}}, {"say": "相对滑动距离等于两段位移之差，也就是 $v$-$t$ 图里阴影的面积。", "tex": "\\Delta x=x_A-x_B=4\\ \\mathrm{m}", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "show": {"span": ["A", "B"]}, "check": {"at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}, "expr": "rel(A)", "value": 4}}], "4": [{"say": "滑块和木板之间：摩擦力乘相对滑动距离。", "tex": "Q_1=\\mu_1mg\\,\\Delta x=16\\ \\mathrm{J}", "at": {"event": "same_velocity", "body": "A"}}, {"say": "共速后假设一起减速，需要的静摩擦力没有超过最大静摩擦力，所以能一起减速。", "tex": "a=\\mu_2g=1\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2},\\quad f=ma=1\\ \\mathrm{N}<\\mu_1mg", "at": {"event": "time", "t": 1.6}, "show": {"forces": ["A"]}}, {"say": "木板和地面之间：摩擦力乘木板走过的路程。", "tex": "Q_2=\\mu_2(M+m)g\\cdot\\dfrac23\\ \\mathrm{m}=2\\ \\mathrm{J}", "at": {"event": "time", "t": 1.9}}, {"say": "全部动能最后都变成了热，两种算法结果一样。", "tex": "Q=Q_1+Q_2=18\\ \\mathrm{J}=\\dfrac12mv_0^2"}]}, "stem": "质量 M = 2 kg 的木板放在水平地面上，木板与地面间动摩擦因数 μ₂ = 0.1；质量 m = 1 kg 的滑块以 v₀ = 6 m/s 滑上木板左端，滑块与木板间 μ₁ = 0.4，木板足够长，g = 10 m/s²。求共速时间、共速速度、滑块相对木板滑动的距离和全过程摩擦生热。", "idea": "滑块和木板要分段看：先有相对滑动，各自用牛顿第二定律；共速后再判断能否一起运动。", "model": [{"from": "滑块", "to": "质点"}, {"from": "木板", "to": "长木板模型"}]}